Rule 1 (tensor shape compatibility for comparison)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 4 (tensor shape compatibility for broadcastable tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1
>>
Rule 6 (tensor shape compatibility for scalar comparison)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float} |= ndim(v_1) = 0 ∧ v_2 ≠ 0
